    "detailed_description": "<h1>LATEST UPDATES</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPEN ALPHA BUILD\u00a0 PLAYTESTING JULY 11th - AUGUST 11!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrating our inclusion in the Upload VR showcase, and the new trailer going up on IGN and Game Trailers we are giving you all a sneak peek / early early access to Pedal Rebel VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which is perfect timing as the Online Leaderboard's, Global Statistics, Community Goals, Challenges and Competitions are LIVE and in full swing:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/314a21355fa14c2f83e9385eb7c9f682.avif?t=1752612702\" data-has-big width=800 height=312 /></span><br><br>Looks at these insane numbers from all of our indie booths at Gaming Expos around Australia:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/7c92113fe5a0dd25a9dffa27543aa37d.avif?t=1752612702\" data-has-big width=800 height=309 /></span><br><br>This new online backend is going to enable so many amazing ways to play, compete, connect and combine the effort of our growing community to tackle in game and in real life challenges and get rewarded with new content and achievements.<br><br>I can wait to get stuck into making more and more ways to play and engage with this game and am almost exclusively fueled by the reactions, comments and enthususiasm that we get to see at events, but now we can see the fruits of our collective efforts and the online activity too.<br><br>Lets keep this momentumn rolling on for 2025 and who knows where we will be at by the years end, thanks again!<br><br>- Toasterface Games<br><br>Thanks to all</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your VR gaming to the next level with PEDAL REBEL VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your body into the action by strapping any VR controller to your leg, jump on any stationary bike and its time to ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge oncoming traffic at breakneck speeds while boosting and stealing energy from other cars as you pass, gaining maximum speed and points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/36df863774a886bce740862229a27d51.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=200 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/36df863774a886bce740862229a27d51.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/36df863774a886bce740862229a27d51.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e8eef5ceb88f3b38c001d99940a047ff.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=200 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e8eef5ceb88f3b38c001d99940a047ff.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e8eef5ceb88f3b38c001d99940a047ff.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e92cd73fb4c38f9ae980c4235120ddeb.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=200 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e92cd73fb4c38f9ae980c4235120ddeb.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e92cd73fb4c38f9ae980c4235120ddeb.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Pedalling Action!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap, Tape, or Tie any VR motion controller to your leg, jump on any stationary bike and you are off and racing, no expensive sensors needed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to  to check out our recommended setups and optional accessories including some you can 3D print or make for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/755776d1b8aeb8efb27a66757751ad8b.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=614 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/755776d1b8aeb8efb27a66757751ad8b.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/755776d1b8aeb8efb27a66757751ad8b.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get in the Zone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fast reaction gameplay so engrossing and addictive, it doesnt even feel like exercise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The speed and thrill keeps you looking for the next speed booster, the next jump, the next unlock,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your reactions to the test while narrowly avoiding traffic to get maximum skill points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lean &amp; Dodge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer your bike by leaning side to side, the faster you go the better the handling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traffic and steal their energy to overcharge your bike, unlocking higher maximum speeds while increasing your score multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/7bac73203fe49b552ef58c55238d983f.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=614 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/7bac73203fe49b552ef58c55238d983f.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/7bac73203fe49b552ef58c55238d983f.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Gameplay: Transform your exercise bike and VR headset into the ultimate gaming setup, and become part of the action as you speed down the busy highways.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Racing Experience: Dodge traffic and steal energy from passing vehicles, to go faster. Lean into turns as you ride through a variety of picturesque locations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guilt-Free Gaming: Enjoy a full gaming experience with an engaging story, compelling characters, and exciting unlocks, all while improving your fitness and health.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Soundtrack: Feel the adrenaline rush as the dynamic electronic soundtrack responds to your speed, intensifying the action and pushing you to go faster.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Yourself: Earn score bonuses and take on challenging missions to unlock new levels and achievements, putting your skills to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Everyone: With live online leaderboards, player rankings, community goals, competitions, challenges and events, can you get to the top?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO COMING SOON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a taste of whats to come with our upcoming demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give us a wishlist and jump into the Discord to be the first to know when the demo drops.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your VR gaming to the next level with PEDAL REBEL VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your body into the action by strapping any VR controller to your leg, jump on any stationary bike and its time to ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge oncoming traffic at breakneck speeds while boosting and stealing energy from other cars as you pass, gaining maximum speed and points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/36df863774a886bce740862229a27d51.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=200 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/36df863774a886bce740862229a27d51.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/36df863774a886bce740862229a27d51.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e8eef5ceb88f3b38c001d99940a047ff.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=200 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e8eef5ceb88f3b38c001d99940a047ff.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e8eef5ceb88f3b38c001d99940a047ff.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/e92cd73fb4c38f9ae980c4235120ddeb.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=200 height=386 ><source src