faster you go the better the handling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traffic and steal their energy to overcharge your bike, unlocking higher maximum speeds while increasing your score multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/7bac73203fe49b552ef58c55238d983f.poster.avif?t=1752612702\" width=614 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/7bac73203fe49b552ef58c55238d983f.webm?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909380/extras/7bac73203fe49b552ef58c55238d983f.mp4?t=1752612702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Gameplay: Transform your exercise bike and VR headset into the ultimate gaming setup, and become part of the action as you speed down the busy highways.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Racing Experience: Dodge traffic and steal energy from passing vehicles, to go faster. Lean into turns as you ride through a variety of picturesque locations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guilt-Free Gaming: Enjoy a full gaming experience with an engaging story, compelling characters, and exciting unlocks, all while improving your fitness and health.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Soundtrack: Feel the adrenaline rush as the dynamic electronic soundtrack responds to your speed, intensifying the action and pushing you to go faster.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Yourself: Earn score bonuses and take on challenging missions to unlock new levels and achievements, putting your skills to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Everyone: With live online leaderboards, player rankings, community goals, competitions, challenges and events, can you get to the top?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO COMING SOON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a taste of whats to come with our upcoming demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give us a wishlist and jump into the Discord to be the first to know when the demo drops.</p>",
    "short_description": "ADRENALINE PUMPING RACING ACTION! Transform any exercise bike into a cyberpunk streetracing VR Simulator! Pedal. lean and dodge, traffic to a dynamic soundtrack. Do you have what it takes to become a Pedal Rebel?",
